1
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,780
快点 乔 擦亮点
Come on, Joe. Buff that sucker.

2
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,080
我怎么教你的
What'd I teach you?

3
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:22,600
真卫生
Sanitary.

4
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,620
乔是要在1940年的火车站里找工作吗
Is Joe applying for a job in a train station in 1940?

5
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,700
我只是在教他些每个男人都该知道的事情
Just teaching him a few things every man should know.

6
00:00:28,028 --> 00:00:29,330
总得有人早点开始教
Someone has to get in there early,

7
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:31,572
不然有时候孩子会变得很滑稽
or sometimes the kid turns out funny.

8
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:33,780
我来了
Knock, knock.

9
00:00:33,923 --> 00:00:34,987
-菲尔 -大家好啊
- Hey, Phil. - Hey, guys.

10
00:00:34,987 --> 00:00:36,242
菲尔 过来
Phil, in here!

11
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,680
你准备好搞定你的网站了吗
You ready to tackle your website?

12
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:39,960
我知道我来早了点
I know I'm here a little early.

13
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,020
我想我要...
I thought I was gonna be --

14
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,080
你能尝出来吗
Do you recognize that?

15
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,600
开玩笑吗 我爱死你的酱了
Are you kidding? I love your sauce.

16
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,300
昨天晚上吃卷饼不小心洒了一点
Some of it fell out of my burrito last night,

17
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,460
洒到遥控器上 我都给舔干净了
and I licked it right off the remote.

18
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,940
那是爱丽丝姑妈新推出的酱
That's Auntie Alice's new sauce!

19
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,900
她偷了我的配方
She stole my recipe!

20
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,140
我知道
I know.

21
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:57,440
我是个动不动就暴走
I am the crazy Colombian that always loses her temper

22
00:00:57,440 --> 00:00:59,940
需要被白人安抚情绪的疯狂哥伦比亚人
and needs to be calmed down by the white people.

23
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:02,140
不 我觉得你还不够疯
No! I don't think you're being crazy enough.

24
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:04,640
我不是个暴力的人 但我知道创作出特别的东西
I'm not a violent man, but I know how nuts it can make you

25
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:07,540
结果却被人偷了 是多么让人生气的事情
to create something special only to have it stolen from you.

26
00:01:07,540 --> 00:01:10,780
你记得有首特别火的歌叫《Happy》吗
Do you remember a hit song called "Happy"?

27
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,880
记得啊 几年前出的吧
Yeah, it was like a couple of years ago

28
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:14,760
鼓掌啊 戴帽子的那个
with the clapping and the hat.

29
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,200
几年前吗
A couple of years ago, huh?

30
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:20,700
在这个出现整整四年后才出的
So a full four years after this burst on the scene.

31
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:21,960
*今儿个我倍儿爽*
*Because I'm snappy*

32
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:26,760
*如果今天很顺利 来和我一起爽*
*Snap with me if you think that today is a good day*

33
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,320
*没错 今儿个我倍儿爽*
*That's right, I'm snappy*

34
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:33,120
*如果今天考了满分 来和我一起爽*
*Snap with me if you took a test and you got an A*

35
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:35,000
*没错 今儿个我倍儿爽*
*You see, I'm snappy*

36
00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:38,100
听着有点像 对吧
Sounds just a little similar, right?

37
00:01:38,566 --> 00:01:40,356
-有点 但是... -谢谢
- A little, but -- Thank you!

38
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:42,700
但你觉得他看过这个吗
But do you think that he saw this?

39
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,920
点击量有27呢
Um, it had 27 views.

40
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,300
拜托 我们要去集市上
Come on. We're going down to that market

41
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:47,840
让那个老女人住手
to make that old bat cease and desist.

42
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,240
爱丽丝姑妈像法瑞尔·威廉姆斯
I will not stand idly by

43
00:01:49,249 --> 00:01:51,382
那样剽窃你的作品 我可不能袖手旁观
while Auntie Alice Pharrell Williamses you.

44
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:53,480
你们俩要去哪里
Where are you two going?

45
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,720
去集市
To the market.

46
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,461
我们需要橄榄[配马丁尼]
We need olives!

47
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,280
灯关掉以后 她就会看到
And then when the lights go out, she'll be able to read

48
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,720
你T恤上的荧光墨迹
the glow-in-the-dark ink on your T-shirt.

49
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:15,340
-天哪 她会爱死的 -她 说谁呢
- Oh, my God. She's gonna love it. - She? Who's she?

50
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,280
你们俩在干什么呢
What are you guys working on?

51
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,441
-没什么 -没什么
- Nothing. - Nothing.

52
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,180
好吧 我懂了
Oh, okay. I get it, yeah.

53
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:21,520
他...我去卧室吧
He's -- I'll just be down in the bedroom, you know,

54
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,603
就...就走廊尽头那个
at the end of the -- at the end of the hall.

55
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:26,860
谢谢你帮我
Hey, thanks for your help.

56
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:28,500
我真的很喜欢那姑娘
I really like this girl,

57
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:30,400
请女孩子参加毕业舞会
and there's just so much pressure

58
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:33,020
总要做点什么特别的 简直太有压力了
to do something spectacular when you ask a girl out to prom.

59
00:02:33,245 --> 00:02:34,714
你家的通风机有问题吗
Is there something wrong with your air vents?

60
00:02:34,714 --> 00:02:36,889
没有 小卡偷听时就会用鼻子呼吸
No, Cam breathes through his nose when he hides.

61
00:02:36,889 --> 00:02:39,778
邀请人参加毕业舞会 谁呀 劳利·沃克吗
A promposal? To who? Laurie Vock?

62
00:02:39,778 --> 00:02:41,523
不会的 她被伊恩·雅各布请去了
Oh, no. She's Ian Jacobs' girl.

63
00:02:41,574 --> 00:02:43,371
梅兰妮·瑞兰斯吗 她你可得小心点
Melanie Rylance? You have to be careful with her.

64
00:02:43,371 --> 00:02:45,167
她的唇疱疹比艾比·布梅斯特还多
She has more cold sores than Abby Burmeister.

65
00:02:45,167 --> 00:02:46,780
不过说真的 卢克 你在这里说的任何东西
But seriously, Luke, everything you say here

66
00:02:46,780 --> 00:02:48,000
都是绝对保密的
is completely confidential.

67
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:50,540
他们都在找舞伴参加毕业舞会
Oh, you know, they are looking for chaperones for prom,

68
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:51,480
-我想也许我们可以 -不行
- and I thought maybe we could -- No, no.

69
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:53,300
我们那天晚上还要去看《卡巴莱》呢
We have tickets to the opening of "Cabaret" that night.

70
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:55,100
我才不要为了让某些十多岁的小姑娘别脱裙子
I'm not missing it so I can tell some teenage girl

71
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:56,160
而错过这个音乐剧
to keep her dress on.

72
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,740
我自己的毕业舞会就是那样干的
I spent my own prom doing that.

73
00:02:57,740 --> 00:03:00,040
好吧 我能提一嘴你请教那个舅舅
Okay, can I just point out the absurdity

74
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:04,500
而不是这个 有多么荒谬吗
that you ask this uncle to advise you and not this uncle,

75
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:08,160
我曾在他办公室外挂了条情人节横幅上面写着
who hung a Valentine's banner outside of his office that said,

76
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:10,380
米奇尔 你是最好的丈夫 父亲和爱人
"Mitchell, you're the best husband, father, and lover."

77
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:12,860
我不喜欢这三个称呼放在同一个句子里
Didn't love all three of those being rolled into one sentence.

78
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:14,344
听着像奥扎克人说的
Sounded a little Ozark-y.

79
00:03:14,344 --> 00:03:15,625
-小卡 住手 -怎么了
- No, Cam. Stop. - What?

80
00:03:15,818 --> 00:03:17,150
卢克只是想请教一个
Luke's just looking for an adviser

81
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,340
简单朴素点
who's a little more understated

82
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:20,340
同时也没那么...你懂的
and a little less, you know...

83
00:03:20,579 --> 00:03:21,628
大卫·斯图尔特的人
David Stuart.

84
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,520
我懂了
Oh, I get it.

85
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,440
-他挺基的 -我知道
- He's quite gay. - Yes, I got it.

86
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,200
好吧 知道吗
Okay, well, you know what?

87
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,840
我也不想让我的天分和派头
I would hate to muck up your promposal

88
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,000
毁了你的毕业舞会邀请
with my flair and panache.

89
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,760
我相信那个幸运的姑娘看到你用芥末酱
I'm sure the lucky girl will swoon with delight

90
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:32,800
在她的火鸡汉堡上
when you use a mustard bottle

91
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,857
写"想去吗"时 会幸福得晕过去的
to write "Wanna go?" On her turkey burger.

92
00:03:36,540 --> 00:03:36,940
你好
Hello?

93
00:03:36,940 --> 00:03:38,320
有人闯进家里了
There's an intruder in the house.

94
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,260
什么
What?!

95
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:41,160
但是有了普里契特3000卫士衣柜
But you have nothing to worry about

96
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:44,040
升级为军用级安全室
with Pritchett's Guardian 3000 Closet,

97
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:46,080
你就无需担心
which doubles as a military-grade panic room.

98
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:47,840
-所以没人闯进来吗 -没有
- So no intruder? - No!

99
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:50,000
就是这个创意让我很激动
I'm just so excited about this idea.

100
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,800
我下周要在橱柜大会上展示一下
I'm debuting it next week at ClosetCon.

101
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,480
你觉得怎么样
What do you think?

102
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:54,340
我觉得我在准备期末考呢
I think I'm studying for finals.

103
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:56,400
你就不能不吓我吗
Can't you scare the crap out of a focus group?

104
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,740
我要在北美最万众瞩目的
Like I'm gonna share my best closet idea

105
00:03:58,740 --> 00:03:59,860
储物大会四天前
with a room full of strangers

106
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:02,200
在一屋子的陌生人面前
four days before the most hotly anticipated

107
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:03,720
展示我最棒的橱柜创意
storage convention in North America.

108
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,760
很好 你有海莉的号码吧
Good point. You do have Haley's number, right?

109
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:11,620
*第一次见到你的时候*
*From the first time that I saw your face*

110
00:04:11,620 --> 00:04:14,220
*就已经知道你是我的真命天女*
*I knew you could be mine*

111
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:19,940
艾丽克斯·邓菲 你愿意让我成为全校最幸福的人
Alex Dunphy, would you make me the happiest cat in school

112
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:21,680
跟我在毕业舞会上摇摆吗
and swing by prom with me?

113
00:04:22,028 --> 00:04:23,330
才...不要
Sha-Na-nope.

114
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:29,680
杰瑞 不知道为什么我用不了我的电脑了
Hey, Jerry. For some reason, I'm locked out of my computer.

115
00:04:31,198 --> 00:04:33,440
很明显 有人在我用之前
Apparently, someone tried to access my e-mail

116
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,490
试图打开我的邮箱
before I got in.

117
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:39,650
有人想泄露公司机密
Someone hell-bent on leaking company secrets.

118
00:04:39,650 --> 00:04:44,830
还有四天就是橱柜大会了 普里契特橱柜居然有内奸
It is four days until C-Con, and Pritchett's Closets has a mole.

119
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:47,050
所有人都有嫌疑
No one is above suspicion.

120
00:04:48,090 --> 00:04:52,490
玛格瑞特 你今天早上9点45分的时候在哪里
Margaret, where were you this morning at 9:45 a.m.?

121
00:04:52,490 --> 00:04:54,150
对不起我迟到了
I'm so sorry I was late.

122
00:04:54,150 --> 00:04:55,610
我去参加暴食匿名互戒会了
I was at Overeaters Anonymous.

123
00:04:55,610 --> 00:04:58,170
我又吃着冰激凌睡着了
I woke up next to the ice cream again.

124
00:04:58,730 --> 00:05:00,070
所以不是玛格瑞特
So not Margaret.

125
00:05:04,850 --> 00:05:06,910
我知道那个柜子是谁的
I know who that locker belongs to.

126
00:05:06,910 --> 00:05:10,690
难以置信你居然要请那个贱霍[货]参加毕业舞会
I can't believe you're asking that cheap Ho to the prom.

127
00:05:10,690 --> 00:05:12,550
-小卡 -萨拉·霍
- Cam! - Sarah Ho!

128
00:05:12,550 --> 00:05:15,830
她在教师节给了我个5元的礼物券
She gave me a $5 gift card for Teacher Appreciation Day.

129
00:05:16,613 --> 00:05:17,585
那些鸟是要干嘛
What's with the birds?

130
00:05:17,585 --> 00:05:21,214
给曼尼邀请舞伴准备的斑鸠
Oh, these are just some turtledoves for Manny's promposal.

131
00:05:21,650 --> 00:05:22,310
你开玩笑呢吧
You're joking.

132
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:24,330
卢克找我帮忙让你感觉被轻视了
You felt so slighted over Luke asking me

133
00:05:24,330 --> 00:05:26,170
你就跑去逼曼尼了吗
that you foisted yourself on Manny?

134
00:05:26,170 --> 00:05:27,793
我才没有逼他
There was no foisting.

135
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:29,790
我问曼尼需要帮忙吗
I asked Manny if he needed help.

136
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:32,910
他太傲慢了不肯承认 所以就这样了
He was too proud to admit that he did, so here we are.

137
00:05:32,910 --> 00:05:34,830
你是不是在这个毕业舞会这件事上
Is it possible there's something deeper going on with you

138
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:36,110
有什么不可告人的秘密啊
around this whole prom area?

139
00:05:36,110 --> 00:05:38,130
你是不是在后悔没准备点
Is it possible you're second-guessing

140
00:05:38,130 --> 00:05:39,570
浪漫点的招啊
your no-frills approach?

141
00:05:39,570 --> 00:05:41,870
特别比起斑鸠啊 伴舞啊
Especially compared to turtledoves, backup dancers,

142
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:45,110
还有干冰 可以让曼尼在一片迷雾中出场
and dry ice so Manny can appear in a cloud of mist.

143
00:05:45,110 --> 00:05:46,510
一片迷雾
A cloud of mist?

144
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:47,650
像电影里那样吗
Like in a movie?

145
00:05:48,682 --> 00:05:50,436
我们的创意会不会有点弱了
Is our thing gonna seem lame now?

146
00:05:50,450 --> 00:05:50,930
淡定
Steady.

147
00:05:50,930 --> 00:05:53,249
好了 我觉得你们的创意还是可以的
Now, now. I'm sure your thing is fine.

148
00:05:53,249 --> 00:05:55,190
看看你们柜子上便条写着啥
What did your little locker note say?

149
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:56,370
"去体育馆"
"Go to the gym."

150
00:05:56,970 --> 00:05:57,430
很神秘哟
Intriguing.

151
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:59,290
体育馆会有什么惊喜等着她呢
What delights await her in the gym?

152
00:05:59,290 --> 00:06:01,690
另一张指示她去停车场的便条
Another note telling her to go to the parking lot.

153
00:06:02,910 --> 00:06:04,170
我还是去帮曼尼准备好吧
Well, I should help Manny set up.

154
00:06:04,170 --> 00:06:05,750
我是不是该慌了呢
Should I be worried?

155
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:07,750
别在这会儿吓我好吧
Don't freak me out right now, okay?

156
00:06:07,817 --> 00:06:09,090
-好吧 -没事的 不会有事
- Okay. All right. - It's fine. Just fine.

157
00:06:09,090 --> 00:06:15,370
你们不一定用得上它 但是起码先拿着
You don't have to use it, but at least you'll have it.

158
00:06:15,370 --> 00:06:17,210
你好 爱丽丝姑妈
Hello, Auntie Alice.

159
00:06:17,210 --> 00:06:19,910
还是爱你死姑妈
Or should she say Auntie Malice?

160
00:06:19,910 --> 00:06:22,130
不 歌洛莉亚说对了 是爱丽丝
No, Gloria's right. It's Alice.

161
00:06:22,350 --> 00:06:24,690
我不知道你今天也进场卖酱
I didn't know you were in today.

162
00:06:24,690 --> 00:06:25,570
你惹上大麻烦了
You're in -- trouble!

163
00:06:26,530 --> 00:06:27,870
他没事吧
Is he okay?

164
00:06:28,010 --> 00:06:29,530
-你偷了我的酱料配方 -什么
- You stole my sauce! - What?

165
00:06:30,450 --> 00:06:32,450
不好意思 可能你的耳朵有点背了
Uh, I'm sorry. Maybe you don't hear so good.

166
00:06:32,910 --> 00:06:38,750
她说的是 "你偷了她的酱料配方"
She said, "You...stole... her...sauce."

167
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:44,010
这酱好辣
That's spicy.

168
00:06:44,090 --> 00:06:45,710
这不是她剽窃的那种酱
That's not the sauce she stole.

169
00:06:45,710 --> 00:06:47,270
那是她的火山酱料
That's her Volcano sauce.

170
00:06:47,270 --> 00:06:51,910
广告里一滴酱就能让曲棍球冰场变成大泳池
In her ad, one drop turns a hockey rink into a swimming pool.

171
00:06:51,910 --> 00:06:56,330
是她新出的那款酱尝着跟我的一模一样
It's her new sauce, the one that tastes just like mine.

172
00:06:56,330 --> 00:06:58,390
你要怎么解释
How are you going to explain that?

173
00:06:58,430 --> 00:07:00,370
对 我们需要解释 再来点面包
Yeah, we want answers and a little bread.

174
00:07:00,370 --> 00:07:02,272
你们不该跟我吵
Your fight's not with me.

175
00:07:04,110 --> 00:07:06,370
我不是真的爱丽丝姑妈
I'm not really Auntie Alice.

176
00:07:06,690 --> 00:07:07,940
得了吧
Oh, come on.

177
00:07:08,230 --> 00:07:10,930
你的小脸蛋就印在瓶子上
Your cute face is in the bottle!

178
00:07:11,270 --> 00:07:15,490
"爱丽丝姑妈"是一间大公司旗下的品牌
Auntie Alice is a brand that was created by a big corporation.

179
00:07:15,490 --> 00:07:17,890
所以是这间公司的人偷了我的配方
So they were the ones who stole my sauce?

180
00:07:17,890 --> 00:07:20,330
他们什么产品都剽窃偷用
They steal all kinds of products.

181
00:07:20,330 --> 00:07:22,570
他们还有一团队的律师
And they have an army of lawyers

182
00:07:22,570 --> 00:07:25,610
专门打压跟他们对着干的人
just ready to crush anyone who challenges them.

183
00:07:25,610 --> 00:07:27,110
那我们只能逆来顺受吗
So we just have to take it?

184
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:30,170
弄到我眼睛里了 天哪
It's in my eye! Oh!

185
00:07:30,170 --> 00:07:33,870
请别把我这事说出去 不然我会失业的
Please don't repeat any of this, or I could lose my job.

186
00:07:34,170 --> 00:07:36,990
我艺术班的学费还没交完呢
I'm still paying off my improv classes.

187
00:07:36,990 --> 00:07:38,570
这么辣怎么能让人吃呢
How is this food?!

188
00:07:39,710 --> 00:07:41,630
这车以后很可能是你的了
This will probably be yours someday,

189
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:43,530
所以你没有理由不学换机油
so no reason you shouldn't learn to do this.

190
00:07:43,550 --> 00:07:45,230
曼尼知道该怎么换油吗
Does Manny know how to change oil?

191
00:07:45,230 --> 00:07:47,970
-他会换沐浴精油 -什么是沐浴精油
- Bath oils. - What? Bath oil?

192
00:07:47,970 --> 00:07:48,930
果然是我儿子
There's my guy.

193
00:07:48,930 --> 00:07:50,430
把油尺给我
Let me grab the dipstick.

194
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:51,350
这根吗
This stick?

195
00:07:56,690 --> 00:07:58,590
曼尼 我已经交代好其他人了
Manny. Okay. I just briefed the team.

196
00:07:58,590 --> 00:08:00,910
干冰准备好了 领结放在鸟身上
Dry ice is ready. Bow ties are on the birds.

197
00:08:00,910 --> 00:08:01,610
别费力了 小卡
Save it, Cam.

198
00:08:01,610 --> 00:08:03,410
梅根已经答应肖恩·里弗斯了
Megan already said yes to Shawn Reeves.

199
00:08:03,410 --> 00:08:04,670
他上个课间问她的
He asked her last period.

200
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:06,130
那可真遗憾 曼尼
Oh, I'm so sorry, Manny.

201
00:08:06,130 --> 00:08:07,330
其实也不能怪她
Can't really blame her.

202
00:08:07,330 --> 00:08:09,059
谁会傻到拒绝肖恩·里弗斯
I mean, you try saying no to Shawn Reeves

203
00:08:09,059 --> 00:08:11,720
他那气象播报员微笑和迷人加拿大口音呢
with his weatherman smile and his exotic Canadian accent.

204
00:08:11,730 --> 00:08:13,850
肯定还有别的姑娘可以做你的舞伴
Well, there must be someone else you can ask.

205
00:08:13,850 --> 00:08:16,290
不用了 没事 反正每年都有机会
No, that's okay. There's always next year.

206
00:08:16,290 --> 00:08:18,210
起码这样我还能看开场的《歌厅》
At least this way I can see the opening of "Cabaret".

207
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:20,130
拜托 只是《歌厅》而已
Oh, please. It's just "Cabaret."

208
00:08:20,210 --> 00:08:22,230
迪克·切尼被救活的次数都没有这部剧多
It's been revived more times than Dick Cheney.

209
00:08:22,350 --> 00:08:24,750
行了 你不能错过你的毕业舞会
Okay. You're not missing your prom.

210
00:08:24,750 --> 00:08:26,530
小卡 其实我感觉
Cam... I'm getting the feeling

211
00:08:26,530 --> 00:08:28,850
你比我还看重我的舞会
this is much more important to you than it is to me.

212
00:08:28,850 --> 00:08:31,010
好吧 可能是因为我自己的没去成
Well, maybe because I didn't get to go to mine.

213
00:08:31,490 --> 00:08:32,650
真遗憾
Oh. I'm sorry.

214
00:08:32,710 --> 00:08:34,030
对 这是一个悲伤的故事
Yeah, it's a painful story.

215
00:08:34,375 --> 00:08:36,250
我懂 有些事还是不说为好
I get it. Some things are better left unsaid.

216
00:08:36,250 --> 00:08:37,310
她的名字叫迪娜·黛
Her name was Tina Day.

217
00:08:37,310 --> 00:08:40,350
我们只是朋友 但我很想邀请她共舞
We were just friends, but I was so into asking her,

218
00:08:40,350 --> 00:08:43,010
我甚至还租了一匹白马和一套铠甲
I rented a white stallion and a suit of armor.

219
00:08:43,010 --> 00:08:45,350
想营造出《危情谍战》里的氛围
I wanted it to be a whole "Knight and Day" Theme.

220
00:08:46,310 --> 00:08:48,790
远在舞会之前 我就向她发出邀请了
I was promposing before it was even a thing.

221
00:08:49,386 --> 00:08:50,610
我骑马骑到她家门口的车道上
I rode up her driveway,

222
00:08:50,610 --> 00:08:52,310
透过我头盔的缝隙
and I could see when she opened the door

223
00:08:52,310 --> 00:08:54,870
看着她开门的时候
through the little slits in my helmet

224
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:56,070
我就知道她的回答是什么了
what her answer was gonna be.

225
00:08:56,070 --> 00:08:58,370
她想和一个能让她失身的男生一起
She wanted a traditional prom night with a guy

226
00:08:58,946 --> 00:09:00,907
享受一个传统的毕业舞会之夜
she could lose her virginity to.

227
00:09:01,970 --> 00:09:03,550
我不能怪她
I couldn't blame her.

228
00:09:03,550 --> 00:09:05,790
我也渴望这么一个男生
I wanted the same thing.

229
00:09:07,529 --> 00:09:08,730
毕业舞会的女伴还有不少人选
There's always Melanie Rylance,

230
00:09:08,730 --> 00:09:10,010
但是你可别想让我去邀请
but you wouldn't want me to ask someone --

231
00:09:10,010 --> 00:09:11,979
伙计们 让舞者和鸽子炮就位
Delta, ready the dancers and dove cannon.

232
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:14,330
可怜的女士
Poor lady.

233
00:09:14,490 --> 00:09:17,150
我真不该那样凶她
I feel terrible for screaming at her like that.

234
00:09:17,490 --> 00:09:18,110
怪我
I blame myself.

235
00:09:18,170 --> 00:09:19,850
我也怪你
I blame yourself, too.

236
00:09:19,850 --> 00:09:20,910
对不起
I'm sorry.

237
00:09:21,490 --> 00:09:23,250
我只是压力太大了
I'm just kind of going through something.

238
00:09:23,830 --> 00:09:26,270
今天早上我参加莉莉的职业日
I got bumped from Lily's career day this morning

239
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:27,470
被一个牙周病医生比下去了
by a periodontist.

240
00:09:27,470 --> 00:09:30,990
也对 我的职业是比不上烂牙根有意思
That's right. My job is less interesting that root rot.

241
00:09:30,990 --> 00:09:33,090
三年级小学生的想法算什么
Who cares about a bunch of third graders?

242
00:09:33,290 --> 00:09:35,810
你喜欢当房地产中介
You love being a real-estate agent.

243
00:09:35,810 --> 00:09:38,250
首先 我不只是一个房地产中介
First of all, I'm not just a real-estate agent.

244
00:09:38,330 --> 00:09:39,370
我是个房地产经纪人
I'm a Realtor.

245
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:41,550
我是全国协会的一员
I'm a member of a national association,

246
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:44,670
宣誓服从房地产经纪人道德规范的一分子
a brotherhood, sworn to the Realtor Code of Ethics!

247
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:46,090
这上面的"徽"就象征了我的身份
That's what this "R" Stands for.

248
00:09:46,790 --> 00:09:49,110
虽然后来我觉得它更像是"悔"
Though, lately, it feels like it stands for "Regret".

249
00:09:49,110 --> 00:09:51,590
关于房地产的一切我无不知晓
I know everything there is to know about real estate,

250
00:09:51,590 --> 00:09:52,710
然而这并没有什么用
and nobody seems to care.

251
00:09:52,710 --> 00:09:54,510
也许我的职业是世界上最无聊的
Maybe I have the most boring job in the world.

252
00:09:54,510 --> 00:09:55,670
不 菲尔
No, Phil.

253
00:09:55,670 --> 00:09:58,610
做衣柜生意才是世界上最无聊的
Closets is the most boring job in the world.

254
00:10:00,533 --> 00:10:02,171
可怜的人
Ay, poor thing.

255
00:10:02,181 --> 00:10:04,210
她还要等公车
She has to take the bus.

256
00:10:04,210 --> 00:10:05,590
我们捎她一段吧
Let's offer her a ride.

257
00:10:05,650 --> 00:10:07,270
行 行
Yes, yes.

258
00:10:12,578 --> 00:10:13,898
她开玛莎拉蒂
A Maserati?

259
00:10:13,898 --> 00:10:16,108
她骗了我们
She lied to us!

260
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,963
不 我是叫你"跟上她"
No, that means "Follow her."

261
00:10:30,410 --> 00:10:31,590
-你好 -妈妈
- Hello? - Hey, Mom.

262
00:10:31,590 --> 00:10:33,270
门前草坪上的洒水器怎么打开
How do you turn on the sprinklers for the front lawn?

263
00:10:34,350 --> 00:10:37,910
在大门旁边有个小的控制盒 怎么了
Uh, it's a little control box by the front door. Why?

264
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:38,910
没什么
No reason.

265
00:10:39,181 --> 00:10:40,590
听着 既然你打给我了
Look, now that I've got you on the phone,

266
00:10:40,590 --> 00:10:43,530
我想说我们是不是该提高网络安全等级了
I'm thinking it might be time to upgrade our Internet security.

267
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:44,190
该怎么做呢
Thoughts?

268
00:10:44,190 --> 00:10:46,230
先撕掉那张粘在你电脑上的
Get rid of the Post-it note on your laptop

269
00:10:46,230 --> 00:10:47,330
写着你密码的便利贴
with your password on it.

270
00:10:48,430 --> 00:10:49,950
你怎么担心起网络安全了
Why are you so worried about security?

271
00:10:50,265 --> 00:10:52,296
这是我第一次以总裁身份参加会议
It's my first ClosetCon as C.E.O.,

272
00:10:52,306 --> 00:10:55,170
而且我发现公司里有间谍
and I am dealing with corporate espionage.

273
00:10:55,170 --> 00:10:56,850
如果你真这么担心
Well, if you're so worried about it,

274
00:10:56,850 --> 00:10:57,930
为什么不直接打给外公呢
why don't you just call Grandpa?

275
00:10:58,270 --> 00:10:59,750
你知道那会多糗吗
Do you know how that would look?

276
00:11:00,090 --> 00:11:01,330
去找你职位的前任寻求帮助
I mean, it's bad enough to go to the person

277
00:11:01,330 --> 00:11:02,930
已经够难堪的了
who had your job before you,

278
00:11:02,930 --> 00:11:04,850
更别提如果这个人是你爸的话
but when that person is daddy...

279
00:11:05,690 --> 00:11:07,950
宝贝 做衣柜生意的人都是冷酷无情的
Honey, closet people are ruthless.

280
00:11:09,110 --> 00:11:10,530
他们会把我生吞活剥的
They'd eat me alive.

281
00:11:10,530 --> 00:11:13,510
也可能这个世界上并不全是冷血怪物
Or maybe the world isn't filled with heartless monsters.

282
00:11:16,830 --> 00:11:17,670
我手机被淋湿了
My phone is wet.

283
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,530
你能打个电话给我妈妈吗
Can you call my mom?

284
00:11:20,110 --> 00:11:21,670
大家好 抱歉我来晚了
Hey, guys. Sorry I'm late.

285
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:22,670
刚刚才跟"宅在架"公司的
I just got off the horn

286
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:25,030
瑞克·弗莱德曼通完电话
with Rick Friedman over at Shelf Involved.

287
00:11:25,030 --> 00:11:26,290
可怜的人啊
That poor guy.

288
00:11:26,325 --> 00:11:30,368
他们那儿有人将公司机密泄露了出去
Someone there has given away corporate secrets.

289
00:11:31,190 --> 00:11:35,130
还好我们公司刚刚升级过安保系统
Makes me so glad that we just upgraded our whole security system.

290
00:11:35,130 --> 00:11:38,470
我的意思是 公司楼里藏了些摄像头
I mean, we got hidden cameras around this place

291
00:11:38,470 --> 00:11:40,510
连我都不知道在哪
that I don't even know about.

292
00:11:42,645 --> 00:11:45,777
所以 我们为玛格丽特的生日买了蛋糕
So, we got a cake for Margaret's birthday.

293
00:11:47,630 --> 00:11:48,270
很好
Fun.

294
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:49,450
你最近如何 本
How you doing, Ben?

295
00:11:51,110 --> 00:11:53,070
我吗 我很好 我很好
Me? I'm good. I am good.

296
00:11:53,070 --> 00:11:53,730
我有点冷
I am chill.

297
00:11:53,730 --> 00:11:55,110
我要去趟洗手间 失陪一下
I'm gonna go to the bathroom, so...

298
00:11:57,070 --> 00:11:59,110
其实今天不是我生日
It's not really my birthday.

299
00:11:59,110 --> 00:12:01,130
我只是想吃蛋糕
I just wanted cake.

300
00:12:01,130 --> 00:12:03,790
我吃垃圾因为我就是个垃圾
I eat garbage because I am garbage.

301
00:12:07,230 --> 00:12:08,570
老爸
Hey, Dad. Hi.

302
00:12:08,570 --> 00:12:09,850
听着 我能等会儿打给你吗
Um, listen. Can I call you back?

303
00:12:09,859 --> 00:12:11,672
我就是确认下晚餐我们一起去...
Just wanted to confirm we're on for dinner at --

304
00:12:11,672 --> 00:12:13,163
另一个电话来了 等等别挂
Oh, got another call. One sec.

305
00:12:13,571 --> 00:12:14,909
我觉得她开始怀疑我们了
Yeah, I think she's onto us.

306
00:12:16,010 --> 00:12:18,190
是的 各种吓唬人的暗示
Yeah, a lot of mole talk.

307
00:12:18,445 --> 00:12:20,448
我认为我们要避避风头...
I think we just need to calm things d--

308
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:21,630
什么
What?

309
00:12:21,848 --> 00:12:23,367
你刚在和她打电话吗
You're talking to her right now?

310
00:12:23,970 --> 00:12:25,750
好吧 拜拜
Yeah, okay, bye.

311
00:12:26,330 --> 00:12:27,510
所以 今晚出去吃饭
So, we're on for tonight?

312
00:12:27,670 --> 00:12:28,510
-没问题 -很好
- Sure. - Great.

313
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:30,350
还有 你听起来有点紧张
And, hey, you sound a little tense.

314
00:12:30,570 --> 00:12:32,110
别被工作逼成个疯婆子 好吗
Don't let the job make you crazy, huh?

315
00:12:32,110 --> 00:12:35,150
压力一大 你看啥都是阴谋
You go that route, soon you're seeing plots everywhere.

316
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:36,470
好建议 老爸
Great tip, Dad.

317
00:12:37,330 --> 00:12:38,690
你在为我爸当间谍
You're spying for my dad!

318
00:12:38,710 --> 00:12:40,550
什么 我没有 好吧 对不起
What? No! Yes. I'm sorry.

319
00:12:40,650 --> 00:12:41,670
我不知道自己为什么同意
I don't know why I agreed.

320
00:12:41,670 --> 00:12:43,410
我只是太仰慕你父亲了
I just look up to your dad so much.

321
00:12:43,410 --> 00:12:45,090
我真不敢相信他不相信我
I can't believe he doesn't trust me.

322
00:12:45,090 --> 00:12:46,650
那他为什么还让我掌管公司
Why did he put me in charge, then?

323
00:12:46,650 --> 00:12:48,090
我不知道 但我能找到原因
I don't know, but I can find out.

324
00:12:48,090 --> 00:12:49,030
我可以当双面间谍
I'll double-agent.

325
00:12:49,264 --> 00:12:51,108
从我父母离婚时起 我就一直从事间谍工作
I've been working this game since my parents' divorce.

326
00:12:51,108 --> 00:12:52,716
我是纽约大颈区唯一一个没有
I was the only 10-year-old in Great Neck

327
00:12:52,716 --> 00:12:54,550
睡前故事和信用卡的十岁小孩
with no bedtime and Diners Club card.

328
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:56,370
够了 你今晚什么事都别安排
Fine. Don't make any plans for tonight.

329
00:12:56,370 --> 00:12:57,690
跟我一起去家庭聚餐
You're coming to dinner with me.

330
00:12:57,690 --> 00:13:00,290
行 我们能顺道去一趟我家让我换双鞋吗
All right. Um, can we stop by my house to change my shoes?

331
00:13:00,410 --> 00:13:02,450
我刚才第一次上马桶时滑了下
I didn't make it up here on the first try.

332
00:13:04,530 --> 00:13:06,147
好了 鸽子加农炮装载完毕
All right, the dove cannon's loaded,

333
00:13:06,157 --> 00:13:08,070
舞者们都在热身 干冰如雾般翻滚
the dancers are stretching, the dry ice is billowing.

334
00:13:08,070 --> 00:13:11,450
你将她带出去的一刹那 我会给小队使暗号
The moment you get her outside, I will cue the team.

335
00:13:11,450 --> 00:13:12,410
她来了
Oh, there she is.

336
00:13:12,410 --> 00:13:13,770
走起
Okay. Go.

337
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:14,930
注意 队员们 注意着点
All right, team. Look alive.

338
00:13:14,930 --> 00:13:16,850
行动开始 行动开始
We are hot. We are hot.

339
00:13:16,850 --> 00:13:17,570
-你好 梅兰妮 听着 -曼尼
- Hey, Melanie. Listen -- - Manny.

340
00:13:17,570 --> 00:13:19,530
你愿意和我一起参加毕业舞会吗
Do you want to go to prom with me?

341
00:13:20,030 --> 00:13:20,630
当然
Uh, sure.

342
00:13:23,990 --> 00:13:25,090
你有时间[第二名]吗
You got a second?

343
00:13:26,050 --> 00:13:26,470
当然
Yeah.

344
00:13:26,470 --> 00:13:27,930
是啊 我是第二名 你是第一名
Yeah, I'm second. You're first.

345
00:13:27,930 --> 00:13:29,050
我懂了 你什么都是赢家
I get it. You win everything.

346
00:13:29,050 --> 00:13:31,350
听起来好像发生了些什么我不知道的
That seems like something I'm gonna hear about later.

347
00:13:31,350 --> 00:13:33,210
卢克的"舞伴请帖"需要人帮忙
I need help with Luke's promposal, okay?

348
00:13:33,210 --> 00:13:35,550
你能去趟健身房 等莎拉来 然后交给她吗
Can you go to the gym, wait for Sarah, and then hand her this?

349
00:13:35,970 --> 00:13:37,610
我已经沦落到干这种事了吗
Okay, this is what I've been reduced to?

350
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:41,010
像个信差似的 派送一封连香水都没喷的请帖 没问题
Delivering an unperfumed envelope like a common bellhop? Fine.

351
00:13:41,010 --> 00:13:42,325
谢谢 拜托了
Thank you. Okay.

352
00:13:42,750 --> 00:13:44,390
解除戒备 所有人员
Stand down, everybody.

353
00:13:45,236 --> 00:13:46,688
小熊精已修得正果
Little Bear's gone rogue.

354
00:13:48,150 --> 00:13:48,570
等等
Wait.

355
00:13:49,448 --> 00:13:50,536
格雷森 你好啊
Grayson! Hey.

356
00:13:50,870 --> 00:13:52,670
-你好 教练 -你好
- Hey, Coach. - Hey.

357
00:13:52,670 --> 00:13:55,710
不用想也知道 你正计划邀请某人去参加舞会
Don't suppose you're planning on asking anyone to prom.

358
00:13:56,050 --> 00:13:58,710
我觉得学校不允许请老师当舞伴
Um, I don't think we're allowed to go with teachers.

359
00:13:58,870 --> 00:13:59,710
我不是这个意思...
That's not what...

360
00:14:00,531 --> 00:14:03,190
看来这就是那个"偷酱贼"的老巢
So, this is the house that stolen sauce built.

361
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:05,750
我气炸了 都不知道该对她说什么了
I'm so angry that I don't even know what I'm gonna say to her!

362
00:14:06,350 --> 00:14:09,510
看来这就是那个"偷酱贼"的老巢
Ah, so, this is the house that the stolen sauce built!

363
00:14:09,730 --> 00:14:13,190
我知道你们怎么想 但这不是我的房子
Oh, I know what you're thinking, but this isn't my house.

364
00:14:13,190 --> 00:14:15,530
我只是过来拿我的工资
I just come here to get my paycheck.

365
00:14:15,530 --> 00:14:16,910
奶奶 我的淋浴头坏了
Grandma, my shower's broken.

366
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:18,437
我去客房那个淋浴间洗澡
I'm gonna use the one in the guesthouse.

367
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:21,070
请当我的钢琴老师吧
Please be my new piano teacher.

368
00:14:23,210 --> 00:14:23,970
我招了
Fine.

369
00:14:23,970 --> 00:14:25,423
我就是爱丽丝姑妈
I'm Auntie Alice.

370
00:14:25,434 --> 00:14:27,510
"盗窃姑妈"还有"谎言姑妈"
Auntie Thief and Auntie Liar.

371
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:29,030
没错 没错
Yeah, yeah.

372
00:14:29,030 --> 00:14:31,210
我相信我们会有到解决方法的
I'm sure we can work something out.

373
00:14:31,210 --> 00:14:32,830
谁是你的专利律师
Who's your patent lawyer?

374
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:33,850
我没有律师
I don't have one.

375
00:14:33,850 --> 00:14:34,750
我就知道
I know.

376
00:14:35,370 --> 00:14:38,330
今早我已经将你的酱申请专利了
I patented your sauce this morning.

377
00:14:39,010 --> 00:14:41,350
回家旅途愉快 孩子们
Have a good trip home, kids.

378
00:14:41,350 --> 00:14:44,650
我真的非常抱歉 菲尔 浪费了你一整天时间
I am so sorry, Phil, that I wasted your whole day,

379
00:14:44,810 --> 00:14:47,450
但我更抱歉的是 我马上要对你车做的事
but I am more sorry of what I'm gonna do to your car!

380
00:14:47,450 --> 00:14:49,070
歌洛莉亚 我们大人有大量
Gloria, we're above that.

381
00:14:49,070 --> 00:14:50,370
不是所有人都有这肚量
But not everyone would be.

382
00:14:50,370 --> 00:14:52,530
你该把你的豪车停在车库里
You should put that beauty in your garage.

383
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:54,610
-我没有车库 -哦 是吗
- I don't have one. - Oh, really?

384
00:14:54,610 --> 00:14:57,450
好奇问一句 你没有车库是因为
Just out of curiosity, do you not have a garage

385
00:14:57,450 --> 00:14:59,190
你把车库改造成了客房
because you converted it into the guesthouse

386
00:14:59,190 --> 00:15:01,050
那个你孙子正在洗澡的地方吗
where your grandson's currently showering?

387
00:15:01,050 --> 00:15:02,490
你在耍什么花招 先生
What's your game, mister?

388
00:15:02,490 --> 00:15:04,090
我只是很好奇你名下有
I just find it interesting that you have

389
00:15:04,090 --> 00:15:06,480
一栋违法私自改造的独立住宅
a fully plumbed stand-alone dwelling on your property.

390
00:15:06,490 --> 00:15:07,870
这不关你的事
That's none of your business.

391
00:15:07,870 --> 00:15:10,630
更奇怪的是 似乎你的孙子也住在这
Even more peculiar, your grandson appears to live here,

392
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:13,930
但从他的T恤衫看 他在伊甸米尔斯高中上学
but judging by his T-shirt, he goes to Eden Mills High,

393
00:15:13,930 --> 00:15:16,390
一所不属于本地区的精英公立学校
an elite public school 12 miles outside of your district.

394
00:15:16,390 --> 00:15:19,010
也许你用在私立学校上省下的钱
Oh, maybe with the money you saved on private schools,

395
00:15:19,010 --> 00:15:21,470
买了那我看到的新的双面砖壁炉
you paid for the new two-sided brick fireplace I saw,

396
00:15:21,470 --> 00:15:23,230
那壁炉自1988年就已被明令禁止了
which hasn't been legal since 1988.

397
00:15:23,230 --> 00:15:24,110
加油 菲尔 加油
Go, Phil, go!

398
00:15:24,110 --> 00:15:25,510
酱紫你还嘴硬吗 偷酱贼
Pull the sauce, Big Al,

399
00:15:26,290 --> 00:15:29,530
否则星期一早晨 你家门前将会有一辆推土机
or Monday morning, the city's here with a bulldozer,

400
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:32,410
你的孙子将戴着金属探测器去学校
and your grandson goes to a school with a metal detector.

401
00:15:32,530 --> 00:15:34,210
你是怎么知道这些的
How do you know all this?

402
00:15:34,210 --> 00:15:37,050
你到底是做什么的 房地产中介人吗
What are you -- some kind of real-estate agent?

403
00:15:37,165 --> 00:15:39,462
不 他是房产经纪人
No. He's a Realtor.

404
00:15:39,770 --> 00:15:41,470
这是有区别的[其实没有]
There is a difference somehow!

405
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:46,230
嘿 孩子们
Oh, hey, kids.

406
00:15:46,230 --> 00:15:48,070
实际上 我在等莎拉
Actually, I'm waiting for Sarah,

407
00:15:48,070 --> 00:15:50,490
所以 如果你们能等一分钟再进来
so if I could have the room for just a -- a minute.

408
00:15:50,490 --> 00:15:51,950
谢谢 好吧 真有趣
Thank -- Okay, funny.

409
00:15:52,310 --> 00:15:54,610
不管是谁把灯关掉了 麻烦你打开好吗
Whoever turned out the lights, please turn them back on.

410
00:15:54,610 --> 00:15:56,870
灯坏了 可能是保险丝烧了
They're not working. Might be a fuse.

411
00:15:59,170 --> 00:16:00,250
米切尔 我们有问题了
Mitchell, we have a problem.

412
00:16:00,270 --> 00:16:01,210
不 我们没有
No, we don't.

413
00:16:03,450 --> 00:16:06,050
我是说 除非你那晚很忙
I mean, unless you're busy that night.

414
00:16:06,729 --> 00:16:08,730
你...你是在邀请我去舞会吗
Are -- Are you asking me to prom?

415
00:16:08,730 --> 00:16:10,450
你知道的 他们要求携舞伴
Well, you know, they need chaperones.

416
00:16:11,070 --> 00:16:12,990
米切尔 这是你为我做的最浪漫的事了
Mitchell, this is the sweetest thing you've ever done for me.

417
00:16:13,130 --> 00:16:15,030
我不知道我有没有提过
I-I don't know if I've mentioned it,

418
00:16:15,030 --> 00:16:16,390
但我从没去过我自己的毕业舞会
but I never got to go to my own prom.

419
00:16:16,650 --> 00:16:17,560
我想起来了
It's come up.

420
00:16:18,205 --> 00:16:19,950
那卢克的"舞伴请帖"怎么办
What about Luke's promposal?

421
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:22,290
你老公我 这个即使拿枪架在头上逼着
Well, your husband, who couldn't plan anything romantic

422
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:23,300
都不能制造浪漫的人
with a gun to his head,

423
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:26,390
可能已经一石二鸟将两个"舞伴请帖"都搞定了
may have pulled off two promposals at once.

424
00:16:28,050 --> 00:16:30,450
你知道是谁把那张便条放我柜子里了吗
Do you have any idea who put that note in my locker

425
00:16:30,450 --> 00:16:31,990
问我是否愿意参加这活动的
asking me to be a part of this thing?

426
00:16:32,070 --> 00:16:33,610
我知道 是我舅舅放的
Oh, yeah, it was my uncle.

427
00:16:34,070 --> 00:16:35,810
他"把灯都关了" 实在是太聪明了
It's pretty clever how he turned out the lights.

428
00:16:36,790 --> 00:16:38,870
我说"把灯都关了"
I said, "Turned out the lights"!

429
00:16:42,250 --> 00:16:44,510
天啊 我愿意
Oh, my God! Yes!

430
00:16:45,510 --> 00:16:47,210
好甜蜜啊 我...
That's so sweet. I...

431
00:16:47,210 --> 00:16:49,210
我真不敢相信 我终于可以去参加高中舞会了
And I can't believe I'm finally going to prom.

432
00:16:49,230 --> 00:16:50,950
我也不敢相信 我终于在高中体育馆
I can't believe I finally have a happy memory

433
00:16:50,950 --> 00:16:51,670
拥有了一点美好的回忆
in a high-school gym.

434
00:16:52,770 --> 00:16:54,210
-乔把你伤成这样的吗 -是啊
- Joe did that to you? - Yeah.

435
00:16:54,210 --> 00:16:55,910
-他把引擎盖砸我手上了 -为什么
- Slammed a car hood on it. - Why?

436
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:56,770
我欠他钱呗
I owed him money.

437
00:16:56,770 --> 00:16:59,530
是我在教他检查油箱时 引擎盖滑落了
It slipped while I was teaching him to check oil.

438
00:16:59,530 --> 00:17:01,720
对个三岁小孩来说 那有点超前吧
Well, that's pretty advanced for a 3-year-old.

439
00:17:01,730 --> 00:17:03,310
我能怎么说呢 我对我的孩子有信心
What can I say? I believe in my kids.

440
00:17:03,530 --> 00:17:03,960
谢谢
Thank you.

441
00:17:06,110 --> 00:17:08,370
看上去很棒 谢谢
Looks good. Thank you.

442
00:17:08,557 --> 00:17:09,447
非常好
Very nice.

443
00:17:10,970 --> 00:17:12,410
我们迅速来过一遍计划
Let's quickly go over the plan.

444
00:17:12,410 --> 00:17:13,930
我爸随时都会到的
My dad's gonna be here any minute.

445
00:17:13,930 --> 00:17:15,510
我们要一步一步来
We're doing this in stages.

446
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:17,990
我出一根手指 意味着你要给他发
One finger means you text him

447
00:17:17,990 --> 00:17:19,510
"我们要把百叶窗部门撤掉"
"We're closing the blinds division."

448
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:20,750
那可是盈利最多的
Our biggest earner?

449
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:23,110
如果我跟他说要撤掉百叶窗部门 他会发疯的
He's gonna lose it if I tell him we're shuttering blinds.

450
00:17:23,149 --> 00:17:26,570
两根手指 你就发"我们要跟罗德·布什米尔合作"
Two fingers, we're partnering with Rod Bushmill.

451
00:17:26,570 --> 00:17:28,530
那个无赖代表了你父亲
That sleazebag represents everything

452
00:17:28,530 --> 00:17:31,390
在整个职业生涯中所极力抵抗的一切东西
your father spent an entire career fighting against.

453
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:34,750
三根手指 你就发"我们不去参加衣柜展览大会了"
Three fingers, we're not going to ClosetCon. Wha--

454
00:17:34,750 --> 00:17:36,570
你到底只是想给你爸一个教训
Are you trying to teach your father a lesson

455
00:17:36,570 --> 00:17:37,490
还是磨灭他的灵魂
or crush his soul?

456
00:17:37,810 --> 00:17:38,610
商场无情 小子
Just business, kid.

457
00:17:40,530 --> 00:17:41,170
魔鬼
Monster.

458
00:17:41,170 --> 00:17:44,070
看上去不错 谢谢
Looks good. Thank you.

459
00:17:45,910 --> 00:17:48,830
鉴于高中舞会就快要举办了
So...with all this prom stuff coming up,

460
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:50,610
你家里是不是也跟我家里一样混乱
is your house as topsy-turvy as ours is?

461
00:17:50,742 --> 00:17:52,150
不算吧 曼尼要带一个姑娘过去
Not really. Manny's taking this girl.

462
00:17:52,150 --> 00:17:53,910
她也没什么特别的 就是挺靠谱的
She's nothing special, but solid.

463
00:17:53,910 --> 00:17:54,850
很可靠
Reliable.

464
00:17:54,850 --> 00:17:56,490
跟我们的百叶窗部门很像
A lot like our blinds division.

465
00:17:56,490 --> 00:17:57,710
虽然不性感 但是...
You know -- not sexy, but --

466
00:17:57,710 --> 00:17:58,930
别 爸 别谈公事
No, Dad. No shop talk.

467
00:17:58,930 --> 00:18:00,650
你已经谈了一辈子工作了
You've had enough of that for a lifetime.

468
00:18:04,053 --> 00:18:06,714
今晚你的手机还真忙啊
Wow, your phone is really blowing up tonight.

469
00:18:07,601 --> 00:18:08,549
两杯老式鸡尾酒
Two old-fashioneds.

470
00:18:08,549 --> 00:18:10,055
-谢谢 -谢谢
- Thank you. - Oh, thank you.

471
00:18:10,168 --> 00:18:10,911
好的 给
Okay. Here.

472
00:18:10,911 --> 00:18:13,468
你觉得现在还有什么是我觉得很老式的吗
You know what else seems old-fashioned to me nowadays?

473
00:18:13,468 --> 00:18:15,469
-什么 -正直
- Mm? - Integrity.

474
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:17,950
或许我的整个职业生涯
Maybe because I spent my career

475
00:18:17,950 --> 00:18:19,630
都在跟行业里的无赖抗争
fighting the sleazeballs in our industry.

476
00:18:19,630 --> 00:18:21,170
就是罗德·布什米尔那一类的
You know -- the Rod Bushmill types.

477
00:18:21,170 --> 00:18:22,070
罗德真是个好人
Rod's a sweetheart.

478
00:18:22,370 --> 00:18:23,250
他上周请我吃午餐了
He bought me lunch last week.

479
00:18:23,250 --> 00:18:24,850
我们谈论了一下是否该...
We got to talking about whether or not we --

480
00:18:24,850 --> 00:18:26,750
我这是在干什么呢
What am I doing?

481
00:18:27,302 --> 00:18:28,999
唠叨着工作上的事
Jibber-jabbering about work.

482
00:18:28,999 --> 00:18:33,526
乔那个小恶魔才三岁
So, that little grease monkey Joe is 3.

483
00:18:33,526 --> 00:18:35,775
真不敢相信 三岁啊
Hard to believe. 3.

484
00:18:36,470 --> 00:18:38,850
小孩子长得可真快啊
They grow up so fast.

485
00:18:40,286 --> 00:18:41,630
不过这种感觉一定很好吧 爸
Got to be nice, though, Dad,

486
00:18:41,630 --> 00:18:43,570
你的公司被我运营得很好
knowing that your company is in good hands

487
00:18:43,570 --> 00:18:45,830
你可以安心在家里整天带小孩玩
and you can stay home all day long and just play with your kid.

488
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:46,910
你是疯了吗
Have you lost your mind?

489
00:18:47,010 --> 00:18:48,230
当然了 也不是玩一整天
Well, not all day, obviously.

490
00:18:48,230 --> 00:18:50,411
三岁的小孩就是狂躁不安的小细菌罐
3-year-olds are nothing but bipolar germ buckets.

491
00:18:50,411 --> 00:18:52,037
你不去参加衣柜展会了吗
You're skipping out on ClosetCon?

492
00:18:52,146 --> 00:18:53,424
-谁告诉你的 -本
- Who told you that? - Ben.

493
00:18:53,424 --> 00:18:55,070
那个小内奸把什么都告诉我了
That little weasel told me everything.

494
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:57,130
听着 我可以容忍你关停百叶窗部门
Listen, I can tolerate shutting down the blinds,

495
00:18:57,130 --> 00:18:59,790
甚至是和罗德·布什米尔合作 但不去参加衣柜展会
even Rod Bushmill, but not showing up for ClosetCon,

496
00:18:59,790 --> 00:19:01,470
你就是明摆着让别人来轻视你
you're asking not to be taken seriously.

497
00:19:01,470 --> 00:19:02,330
天啊 克莱尔
My God, Claire!

498
00:19:02,784 --> 00:19:05,710
我们只要再迎来一个强势售卖季 就可以获邀
We're one strong season away from being invited

499
00:19:05,710 --> 00:19:08,354
参加衣柜世博会了
to Expo Internationale du Closets!

500
00:19:10,170 --> 00:19:11,590
你为什么这样看着我
Why are you looking at me like that?

501
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:13,470
因为我并没有做那些事
'Cause I'm not doing any of those things.

502
00:19:13,470 --> 00:19:16,350
我让那个小内奸本故意给你发这些信息
I told that little weasel Ben to text you those things

503
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:19,330
因为我发现他是你安插的小间谍
when I found out that he was spying for you.

504
00:19:19,601 --> 00:19:22,090
顺便说下 当我知道你不信任我
And, by the way, it doesn't feel very nice

505
00:19:22,090 --> 00:19:24,410
可以运营好你的公司 那种感觉并不好受
to know that you don't think that I can run your company.

506
00:19:24,410 --> 00:19:25,290
那不是我这么做的原因
That's not why I did it.

507
00:19:25,290 --> 00:19:27,670
我心想着 或许你需要一点支持
I thought maybe you could use a little support.

508
00:19:27,670 --> 00:19:30,499
你的准备工作做得还不够好
You're staring down the barrel of your first ClosetCon.

509
00:19:30,690 --> 00:19:31,970
所以你就派人监视我吗
So you spied on me?

510
00:19:32,150 --> 00:19:33,430
你可以给我打个电话的啊
I mean, you could have given me a call.

511
00:19:33,430 --> 00:19:35,270
然后告诉你 你工作做得不好吗
And tell you that you're not doing your job?

512
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:37,230
说得好像你能接受似的
That would have gone over fine with you.

513
00:19:42,130 --> 00:19:42,910
需要帮助吗
Need any help?

514
00:19:42,910 --> 00:19:44,060
-不需要 -不需要
- No! - No.

515
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:46,410
瞧瞧我们
I mean, look at us.

516
00:19:46,410 --> 00:19:47,510
我们怎么就不能都承认
Why can't we both admit

517
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:49,830
我们现在需要彼此的帮助呢
that we could use each other's help right now?

518
00:19:50,150 --> 00:19:51,950
难道我们太高傲了 连这都不愿意吗
Are we too proud to even do that?

519
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:52,970
如果你承认 我就承认
I'll admit it if you will.

520
00:19:52,970 --> 00:19:54,611
好吧 数到三
Fine. On 3.

521
00:19:56,998 --> 00:19:58,350
-你能帮我破开龙虾吗 -我想回去工作
- Will you crack my lobster? - I want to come back to work.

522
00:19:58,350 --> 00:19:59,390
-什么 -该死的
- What?! - Damn it!

523
00:19:59,470 --> 00:20:01,330
天啊 你竟然想回去工作
Oh, my God. You want to come back to work?

524
00:20:01,450 --> 00:20:02,390
我很想念那种感觉
I miss it, okay?

525
00:20:02,870 --> 00:20:04,810
你明白对衣柜行业的热爱深入血液是什么感觉
You know how it is when you have closets in your blood.

526
00:20:04,850 --> 00:20:06,910
我退休后都快要疯了
I'm going crazy in retirement.

527
00:20:07,850 --> 00:20:09,250
你为什么要对我露出这样的笑容
Why are you smiling at me like that?

528
00:20:09,290 --> 00:20:10,510
因为我们父女俩太像了
Because we're so similar.

529
00:20:10,510 --> 00:20:12,430
你知道我有多少次想给你打电话
Do you know how many times I've wanted to call you

530
00:20:12,430 --> 00:20:14,070
向你寻求帮助或建议
to ask for your help or advice,

531
00:20:14,070 --> 00:20:15,870
但我却害怕让自己显得很弱吗
but I was afraid I would look weak?

532
00:20:17,770 --> 00:20:19,410
给 你帮我破开
Here. You crack this.

533
00:20:19,479 --> 00:20:21,497
-给我 -我来剥这些
- Give me that. - I'll open these things.

534
00:20:22,190 --> 00:20:26,110
爸 你想回来工作吗
Well, Dad, what do you think about coming back to work --

535
00:20:26,110 --> 00:20:28,190
比如 每周工作一两天怎么样
I don't know -- one or two days a week?

536
00:20:28,190 --> 00:20:31,010
我的想法是 给我5名员工
What I was thinking was, I'd have a staff of five.

537
00:20:31,010 --> 00:20:32,770
-给我一栋独立办公楼 -什么
- My own building. - What?

538
00:20:32,770 --> 00:20:34,270
并且不要给我安排任何上级
And I report to no one.

539
00:20:35,410 --> 00:20:36,210
我开玩笑的
I'm kidding.

540
00:20:36,910 --> 00:20:38,410
我在打印室放张桌子就行了
I'll put a desk in the copy room.

541
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:41,247
顺便说下 我对你有很深的了解
And, by the way, I've known you for a long time.

542
00:20:41,330 --> 00:20:44,110
你最不需要担心的 就是显得很弱
The last thing you need to worry about is looking weak.

543
00:20:47,410 --> 00:20:49,870
向别人开口寻求你想要的东西并不容易
It's not always easy to ask for what you want,

544
00:20:49,870 --> 00:20:51,550
不管是一点点浪漫
whether it's a little romance...

545
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:53,070
一点点帮助
or a little help...

546
00:20:56,310 --> 00:20:57,530
还是一点点尊重
or a little respect.

547
00:20:58,190 --> 00:21:00,910
-所以我很欣赏你们开口... -我不
- So, I admire you for asking -- - I don't.

548
00:21:00,910 --> 00:21:02,650
我们都知道他们的目的
We both know why they're asking.

549
00:21:02,650 --> 00:21:05,830
不行 你们不能用我们家楼上公寓开余兴派对
No, you may not use our upstairs apartment for an after party.

550
00:21:06,830 --> 00:21:07,430
真挫
Lame.

551
00:21:08,490 --> 00:21:10,130
你看上去令人迷醉 亲爱的
You look ravishing, my sweet.

552
00:21:10,130 --> 00:21:10,970
我们说好了不交谈的
We said no talking.

553
00:21:11,930 --> 00:21:14,670
-来 再来 -我好渴
- Come on. Come on. - I'm thirsty.

554
00:21:14,730 --> 00:21:15,790
我来决定你什么时候才是真的渴
I'll tell you when you're thirsty.

555
00:21:15,810 --> 00:21:17,150
来 让我感受到你的力量
Come on. Let me feel that power.

556
00:21:17,190 --> 00:21:18,890
来 把皮手套打得爆响吧
Come on. Make that leather sing!

557
00:21:18,890 --> 00:21:20,230
好了 骑车去
All right. Come on. Get on your bike.

558
00:21:20,230 --> 00:21:21,710
退后 上车 快
Back up. Get on your bike. Come on.

559
00:21:21,710 --> 00:21:23,250
如果他们抓不到你 就打不到你
They can't hit you if they can't reach you.

560
00:21:23,250 --> 00:21:24,690
我的裤子要掉了
My pants are falling.

561
00:21:24,690 --> 00:21:25,614
拉起来啊
Well, pull 'em up.

562
00:21:25,614 --> 00:21:27,010
拉到胸部去
Pull 'em up high to your nipples.

563
00:21:27,010 --> 00:21:28,290
那样就能避免"爆蛋"了
That prevents a low blow.

564
00:21:28,430 --> 00:21:29,510
"爆蛋"是什么
What's a low blow?

565
00:21:29,510 --> 00:21:30,330
好极了
Fantastic.

566
00:21:30,330 --> 00:21:33,210
我明天要主持一个诗歌怀旧会
I have to emcee a poetry retrospective tomorrow,

567
00:21:33,210 --> 00:21:35,050
但这件围巾领西装上的皱纹
and this shawl collar's got more wrinkles

568
00:21:35,050 --> 00:21:36,690
比昨晚的《唐顿庄园》还要多
than last night's "Downton Abbey."

569
00:21:37,230 --> 00:21:38,190
就是这样的
That is.
